From 04bf053778af9ef9dc55752f4f88174af7cd7104 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dineshr93 <dineshr93@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:24:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in SBOM generation for dependency configurations

Adds an sbom task that walks the resolved dependency graph of the
configured configurations and writes an NTIA-minimal SBOM as JSON.

- SbomReportTask: @Option --configuration, configurable ListProperty
  configurations and RegularFileProperty output (convention
  build/reports/sbom/sbom.json). No protobuf runtime in Gradle, so the
  document is written with a hand-rolled encoder.
- DiagnosticsTaskNames.SBOM_TASK / HelpTasksPlugin.SBOM_TASK so the
  name is a single override point, matching DEPENDENCIES_TASK.
- Deterministic output: nodes sorted by purl, edges sorted by
  (from, to), timestamp from SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH when set.
- Opt-in only: nothing runs unless the task is invoked.

Omitted and documented: supplier and hash are not available from the
resolved component results, so those NTIA elements are left out.

Signed-off-by: dineshr93 <dineshr93@gmail.com>
